      "data": {
        "title": "Where is the Handler chosen?",
        "question": "Should the Bridge Editor pick the Handler for each imported Event, or should that stay a choice made in the Handler's own editor?",
        "status": "open",
        "answer": "Both, over the same data. The Import Bridge owns the subscription, so the Bridge Editor shows and edits it. The Handler editor still lets an author start from the Handler and choose an Event. Either edit writes the same subscription through the same planner.",
