        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# The Bridge Editor\n\nA Bridge is edited on the Bridge. Its editor should hold its target, what it exposes and consumes, the Events that cross it, and the Handlers that answer them, with a Status that says what is broken.\n\nThe stroke control idea depends on class events crossing Bridges: `github://mikemartinez1974/public/ideas/stroke-control/root.node`."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "bridge-editor"
        }
      }
    },
